      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPLASH OF PAYNT (2) won at this track two runs ago before having his colours lowered at his latest appearance over 1800m at this track, beaten 7 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. This should be an easier assignment so he is a major player. MAGIC STORM (8) produced a good effort at her latest run to get home by a narrow margin over 2050m at Port Pirie on October 10. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Leading hope in a similar race. CLASSIC LINE (11) is right in contention after finishing in the placings for the second time in a row last start, beaten 2.5 metres into second at this track. No reason he cannot take this out. WHATA OPTIMIST (1) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound third at this track over 1800m.",
